>> w := ['A_bottle_of_Whisky and a rare steak.'].
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Basic test, grab the bottle! ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:2 dherer: 6), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:8 dherer: -6), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:2 dherer: 6), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:8 dherer: -6), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Take a single char ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:7 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:7 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== The 0 case, empty string ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:7 dherer: 0), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:7 dherer: 0), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Edge case, first character only ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:0 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:0 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:1 dherer: -1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:1 dherer: -1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Edge case, last character only ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:35 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:35 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:36 dherer: -1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:36 dherer: -1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Out of bounds, empty string ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:36 dherer: 37), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:36 dherer: 47), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:-1 dherer: -2), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:-2 dherer: -1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['=== Part out of bounds, full string ==='], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:-20 dherer: 90), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:90 dherer: -20), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:-20 dherer: 90), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['>']+(w koobiyee ka:90 dherer: -120), sadar-cusub.
